+risk_id,area,evidence,impact,mitigation,owner_hint
+"R1","storage/data durability","minisvc/storage/repo.py:17-29 opens a fresh sqlite3 connection per operation against a file path from config, with no backup, journaling tuning, or explicit error handling","Order data durability depends on local filesystem behavior and process working directory; operational failures can lead to unavailable or misplaced data","Pin an absolute database path, define backup/restore expectations, and add operational checks around database availability and SQLite errors","Backend and platform"
